@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Team Role API Permissioning
	Testing Koroneiki Team Role API Permissioning functionality.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the team roles on koroneiki with the following names
	| Default Account Role  |
	| Optional Account Role |

Scenario: Create team role attempt
	Koroneiki team roles should not be able to be created by non permissioned users.

	Given I attempt to create a team role on koroneiki with the following values as a non permissioned user
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Account Role"

Scenario: View team role attempt
	Koroneiki team roles should not be viewable by non permissioned users.

	Given I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Account Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Account Role" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: Update team role attempt
	Koroneiki team roles should not be able to be updated by non permissioned users.

	Given I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I attempt to update a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Account Role" to have the following values as a non permissioned user
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                                |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Account Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Optional Account Role"
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Account Role" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: Delete account team role and view
	Koroneiki account team role deleted via API should not be viewable via API.

	Given I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I attempt to delete a team role on koroneiki with the name "Default Account Role" as a non permissioned user
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Account Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Account Role" as a non permissioned user